<div class="card mb-4 shadow-sm border-0">
  <div class="card-header bg-white border-bottom">
    <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold text-primary">
      <i class="bi bi-list me-2"></i>Campos do Formulário de Captação
    </h6>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
      Defina os campos que o lead preencheu no formulário de captação. 
      Campos com tipo <code>phone</code>, <code>email</code>, <code>whatsapp</code>, <code>cpf</code>, 
      <code>cnpj</code> ou <code>address</code> serão automaticamente sanitizados antes de enviar ao modelo IA (LGPD).
    </p>

    <div id="fields-container">
      <% if @lead.form_fields_array.any? %>
        <% @lead.form_fields_array.each_with_index do |field, idx| %>
          <% unique_index = "exist_#{idx}_#{@lead.id || Time.current.to_i}" %>
          <%= render "leads/form_fields_field", index: unique_index, field: field %>
        <% end %>
      <% else %>
        <!-- Campo vazio inicial -->
        <% unique_index = "new_0_#{Time.current.to_i}" %>
        <%= render "leads/form_fields_field", index: unique_index, field: { "label" => "", "type" => "text", "value" => "" } %>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-3">
      <button type="button" id="add-field" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">
        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i> Adicionar Campo
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="add-phone" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
        <i class="bi bi-telephone me-1"></i> Telefone
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="add-email" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
        <i class="bi bi-envelope me-1"></i> E-mail
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="add-textarea" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
        <i class="bi bi-textarea me-1"></i> Texto Longo
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="add-select" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
        <i class="bi bi-list-ul me-1"></i> Seleção
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Template oculto para adicionar novos campos via JS -->
    <div id="field-template" style="display: none;">
      <div class="field-row row g-3 mb-3 p-3 border rounded bg-light" id="field-NEW_FIELD_INDEX">
        <input type="hidden" name="lead[form_fields_attributes][NEW_FIELD_INDEX][_destroy]" value="0" class="field-destroy">

        <div class="col-md-3">
          <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Label do campo</label>
          <input type="text" name="lead[form_fields_attributes][NEW_FIELD_INDEX][label]" class="form-control form-control-sm field-label" value="" placeholder="Ex: Quantos funcionários?">
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-2">
          <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Tipo</label>
          <select name="lead[form_fields_attributes][NEW_FIELD_INDEX][type]" class="form-select form-select-sm field-type">
            <option value="text">Texto</option>
            <option value="select">Seleção</option>
            <option value="phone">Telefone</option>
            <option value="whatsapp">WhatsApp</option>
            <option value="email">E-mail</option>
            <option value="cpf">CPF</option>
            <option value="cnpj">CNPJ</option>
            <option value="address">Endereço</option>
            <option value="textarea">Texto Longo</option>
            <option value="password">Senha</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Valor da resposta</label>
          <input type="text" name="lead[form_fields_attributes][NEW_FIELD_INDEX][value]" class="form-control form-control-sm field-value" value="" placeholder="Resposta do lead...">
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-2 d-flex align-items-end">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm remove-field w-100" onclick="removeField(this)">
            <i class="bi bi-trash"></i> Remover
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert alert-info mt-3 border-0 bg-light">
      <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i>
      <strong>Dica:</strong> Use o botão "Adicionar Campo" para criar quantos campos precisar. 
      Cada campo precisa de: <strong>Label</strong> (nome do campo), <strong>Tipo</strong> e <strong>Valor</strong> (resposta do lead).
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
